This repository is the emulation core only: the ARM60, MADAM, CLIO, the DSP,
SPORT, VDLP, XBUS, the PBUS pad chain and CD/CHD media handling, reached through
the C interface in include/retro3do.h. It carries no user interface, no window,
no audio device and no platform layer. Applications wrapping it carry their own
notices for their own components; nothing in this file covers them.

The core contains separately licensed components. Their copyright and licence
terms remain in force and are collected in docs/THIRD_PARTY.md and the
corresponding third_party/* licence files. They are libchdr (BSD-3-Clause) and
its bundled miniz (MIT), LZMA SDK (public domain) and zstd (BSD selected).
Portions informed by MAME carry the BSD-3-Clause notices recorded in
docs/THIRD_PARTY.md.

No commercial or third-party 3DO BIOS or game image is included. The core does
contain the small project-owned demonstration boot ROM in core/demo_rom_data.h,
which is a hardware test rather than a BIOS: it cannot boot a commercial disc.
Whoever supplies a BIOS or a disc image is responsible for having the rights to
it.

